talk ({"Sure don't know what I'm goin' for, but I'm gonna go for it for sure.","If its seeds you're after, I'm the man you want.","I know everthing about seeds.","Have you talked to my friend Jerry Garcia?","Farmers are the best people in the world.","How have the plants been looking this season?",})
